The dream scenario that you read about is that when you

01:05:34.030 --> 01:05:36.985
plot the singular values by their rank,

01:05:36.985 --> 01:05:40.840
you see a bunch of high values and then a really rapid drop-off.

01:05:40.840 --> 01:05:42.220
And if you saw that,

01:05:42.220 --> 01:05:43.405
you'd say, "Oh good,

01:05:43.405 --> 01:05:46.360
